1
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:14,999
[Music] First of all, I thank the Holy Mother of God.

2
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:22,999
I don’t have any prior experience of giving a testimony. This is the first time I am giving a testimony in my life. My name is Lijo Joy.

3
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:34,999
My wife’s name is Monisha. The name of the child we received is Nathania. I am from Pathanamthitta district, Elavanthitta is my place.

4
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:39,999
As I said, this is the first time I am giving a testimony, so there may be some shortcomings in it.

5
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:48,999
I will speak about the blessing I received from Mother. After our marriage, for 10 years, we did not have children.

6
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:53,999
We did many treatments during that time.

7
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:01,999
Because of that, there were some financial difficulties. My house was seized, and such problems were there.

8
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:04,999
In the midst of those problems, we had no children.

9
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:13,999
We did some treatments, and a lot of money was spent. Then, by chance, I happened to listen to a testimony.

10
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:21,999
At that moment, a big spark came into my heart, because—why shouldn’t I also…

11
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:29,999
A thought came to me — why don’t I come and take the covenant? Even if I am not worthy enough.

12
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:34,999
I had many shortcomings. But still, from within me, there was no clear idea or understanding about taking the covenant.

13
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:41,999
I didn’t know how to do it.

14
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:47,999
One day, I told my wife like this. In the morning, I left from home and came here to take the covenant.

15
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:54,999
I didn’t know what exactly to do. I asked here, and as per the instructions given, I took the covenant and received the number.

16
00:01:55,000 --> 00:02:02,999
In November 2023, I came and took the covenant. After taking the covenant, I went back.

17
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:08,999
After taking the covenant, I continued praying daily. Here there is morning prayer.

18
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:17,999
In the evening too, there is prayer. They used to pray the rosary. Since we had no children, I used holy oil every evening.

19
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:25,999
I used to make the sign of the cross on my stomach with holy oil. Father had instructed, “Recite the Creed and then make the sign of the cross with holy oil.”

20
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:29,999
So, I did it exactly like that for three months.

21
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:36,999
Three months passed after taking the covenant. But there was no result.

22
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:44,999
Then a little discouragement came to me — maybe I didn’t do it properly, or I didn’t know why.

23
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:54,999
In March, after the 15th, her period did not come. So, we got a doubt.

24
00:02:55,000 --> 00:03:00,999
Then I went to the medical shop, bought a strip, and checked.

25
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:03,999
When I checked, it was positive.

26
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:10,999
I felt great joy. But I couldn’t believe it, because earlier there had been two miscarriages.

27
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:15,999
So, I couldn’t trust that this would also really be positive.

28
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:26,999
Then, to confirm, we wanted to do a blood test. We had a friend who is a doctor. When we asked the doctor, he told us to do a blood test and check the result properly.

29
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:29,999
So, I did the blood test.

30
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:35,999
When the blood test result came, it was positive, and the count was sufficient. The doctor said, “This is okay.”

31
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:47,999
I thought it would be enough to rest, but at that time I didn’t know what to say, because those who live without children understand the difficulties. It is very heavy.

32
00:03:48,000 --> 00:04:01,999
That Mother  helped me so much, because I cannot explain it in words.

33
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:07,999
As I said, I have no experience of giving a testimony. So,

34
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:14,999
I did not know how to express my gratitude properly. After that, Mother

35
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:21,999
completely spoke about the child. At that time, I said to Mother in my home.

36
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:27,999
I said to Mother, “Mother, I will come to give testimony. I will give testimony with the child.” From the beginning,

37
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:30,999
I used holy oil on my stomach.

38
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:34,999
Even when she was pregnant, she applied holy oil. Then, people hear many things.

39
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:39,999
There could be complications or problems for the child in the womb.

40
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:48,999
After all that, there was a mental fear. Because after so many years, this fear came mentally.

41
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:56,999
I said that if the child has any kind of problem, we don’t have the money. As I said earlier, there were many financial difficulties.

42
00:04:57,000 --> 00:05:03,999
Even, while she was pregnant, I apply holy oil. I applied holy oil and recited the Creed.

43
00:05:04,000 --> 00:05:09,999
Even when doing the tests, everything came positive.

44
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:17,999
Even in the fifth month, it is known. During the fifth month, there is a test to check whether the child is fully healthy.

45
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:22,999
After doing it, I received the report that the child is completely healthy.

46
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:34,999
Thus, on 2024 November, the child was born on the 12th. When the child was born, God gave us a fully healthy child.

47
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:39,999
I thank God and the Holy Mother very much for that. Likewise,

48
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:52,999
before taking the covenant, I had a small habit — drinking alcohol. Then, with this covenant, I received the grace to completely avoid alcohol.

49
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:59,999
Earlier, even using alcohol was difficult for me. Tasting it was even difficult, because I had an attachment before. People who drink alcohol know its difficulties.

50
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:11,999
There was an attachment, but I was completely able to change it, because I no longer desired it. Even now, I have not used it.

51
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:19,999
That is why, a year ago, I did some paperwork for Canada. Through a friend, it cost me some money.

52
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:27,999
I tried it thinking, if somehow it can work, let it work. I did this before taking the covenant.

53
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:35,999
I told Mother, “Mother, I don’t have money. If it works or not, let it be done according to Your will.”

54
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:45,999
I said that, and I also wrote it in the covenant. After writing, it was like that.

55
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:54,999
In March, at the end of the month, it turned out to be fake. Many people lost money, though I did not lose that much.

56
00:06:55,000 --> 00:07:01,999
Some of my money was lost. But Mother revealed to me that it was fake. For that, I thank Mother very much.

57
00:07:02,000 --> 00:07:11,999
Likewise, I have forgot something to tell father. It is about the covenant medal. Earlier, I had a small gold chain,

58
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:20,999
and I had inserted this medal into that chain. After inserting the covenant medal, I didn’t know about it, because Father had told to put the locket.

59
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:26,999
Many people had told me that during the covenant, the locket should always be with me.

60
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:31,999
So, everyone said that. I don’t usually use my purse much, but I…

61
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:36,999
The covenant locket, covenant medal. I had inserted it into the chain.

62
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:43,999
After some time, the child happen to break the chain. This happened just a few days ago.

63
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:48,999
It broke about two to three weeks ago.

64
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:55,999
I went without the covenant medal during that time. When I walked without it, I experienced a feeling that I want to share with you.

65
00:07:56,000 --> 00:08:02,999
I felt intense anger. When I saw others, I felt no empathy — just anger.

66
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:09,999
This intense anger is like rage. It is difficult to describe, but it was anger for everything.

67
00:08:10,000 --> 00:08:16,999
Anger towards everyone, a feeling without any love for anyone. After that, I didn’t understand anything.

68
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:25,999
Later, when I renewed the covenant for the third time, I felt that I should wear the covenant medal.

69
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:32,999
So, I made a small chain and placed the covenant medal in it. From then until now, I have never removed it.

70
00:08:33,000 --> 00:08:39,999
I cannot describe the feeling inside — it is a very intense feeling.

71
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:44,999
It is also a kind of joy, because now,

72
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:51,999
even if there is anger or conflict with anyone, or even if someone comes to argue, I just stand there quietly. That is the feeling I have.

73
00:08:52,000 --> 00:08:58,999
Likewise, I had one of the best experiences after taking the covenant.

74
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:03,999
The blessing I received from God when I took this covenant was something I had never experienced before.

75
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:11,999
Earlier I don't pray the rosary enough, it was only on occasions like going to the church or when someone asks me. But now I pray daily.

76
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:15,999
I was able to do this because of my small construction work —  a little welding at a workshop.

77
00:09:16,000 --> 00:09:20,999
Whenever I could, I did my little work, reciting the rosary while doing it.

78
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:26,999
While sitting there, I prayed the rosary. Even during that,

79
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:34,999
I felt a kind of inspiration for prayer, a new desire to pray more.

80
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:39,999
When I received that feeling, my father told me to take a one-day fast in a week.

81
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:47,999
I chose Saturday for the fast. After taking the fast on Saturday, I randomly went for daily worship on the first two or three days.

82
00:09:48,000 --> 00:09:51,999
There is a chapel a little distance away. I would sit there for an hour, praying silently.

83
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:56,999
I must sit silently; there is no need for extra prayers. Sitting silently,

84
00:09:57,000 --> 00:10:01,999
I prayed the rosary and prayed. I still follow this practice.

85
00:10:02,000 --> 00:10:08,999
But through this, I realized: no matter how much we acquire on this earth — even if we had billions,

86
00:10:09,000 --> 00:10:14,999
I don’t have possessions; even if someone says we have billions, it has no meaning.

87
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:19,999
I understood that earthly wealth has no value, because in eternal life,

88
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:25,999
after leaving this earth, we need eternal life. To obtain it, only worldly wealth doesn’t help.

89
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:32,999
Even if we gain positions and acquire billions on earth, it has no meaning. That understanding still remains in my mind.

90
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:37,999
My mind has revealed this to me. Just recently, even in a dream, I realized it.

91
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:43,999
I received a revelation that I have not shared with anyone until now. I haven’t even told my wife.

92
00:10:44,000 --> 00:10:49,999
The time for revealing it has come. After receiving this experience,

93
00:10:50,000 --> 00:10:53,999
it felt like a heavenly feeling, an intense joy — a tremendous happiness.

94
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:59,999
Even compared to other experiences here, it is an intense joy, but I still cannot fully comprehend it.

95
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:02,999
I don’t know if it’s because I haven’t shared it with anyone.

96
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:08,999
That was the feeling — a glimpse of the greatness of heaven revealed to me. Then,

97
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:15,999
being closer to Mother brought me great joy and grace. That is how I feel now.

98
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:25,999
Likewise, because of work, I had a small construction before. But it was not widely known to anyone.

99
00:11:26,000 --> 00:11:30,999
I was almost jobless. People who work in such areas know.

100
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:40,999
People usually give many advertisements and meet many people, that's how it is done, but even with small work,

101
00:11:41,000 --> 00:11:49,999
during all these years of having this covenant, I have not gone somewhere to ask for my work from anyone.

102
00:11:50,000 --> 00:11:58,999
When one work finishes, I don’t even know how the next work will come automatically. By God’s grace, it happens, and I don’t know how.

103
00:11:59,000 --> 00:12:06,999
Likewise, one of my desires was to take on the work of a church — not a large church, just a small one.

104
00:12:07,000 --> 00:12:16,999
I was able to do it, and it is still ongoing. That was a tremendous blessing. How I got this work, I do not know.

105
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:30,999
I can say 100% that it was solely by Mother’s blessings. It is still ongoing, but I don’t know it's even proceeding.

106
00:12:31,000 --> 00:12:43,999
Mother reveals it to me at the right time. Only the father at that church knows; I share with him. Mother reveals to me how to do everything.

107
00:12:44,000 --> 00:12:50,999
That’s how I am still doing this work. I am not an engineer; I am just a 10th-grade student.

108
00:12:51,000 --> 00:13:01,999
Since my school days, I have been working. I did not had a father guiding me. I just studied in ITI. I am not even an engineer or an architect.

109
00:13:02,000 --> 00:13:09,999
This is my life experience. It is just one experience, but beyond that, there is nothing to compare.

110
00:13:10,000 --> 00:13:19,999
I received this experience in a way that cannot be explained — something revealed instantly to someone who knows nothing.

111
00:13:20,000 --> 00:13:31,999
It is difficult to understand. When someone with education explains it to you,

112
00:13:32,000 --> 00:13:38,999
you can recognize it. But this was revealed to me without any guidance.

113
00:13:39,000 --> 00:13:47,999
Even in my dream, it revealed itself to me. I understood how it should be done, but

114
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:53,999
it is a tremendous miracle. I don’t know how it should be explained to you.

115
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:59,999
This great blessing was given to me by the Holy Mother. As I said, I have no experience of giving testimony.

116
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:05,999
This is my first time giving a testimony in life — a tremendous blessing from the Holy Mother.

117
00:14:06,000 --> 00:14:13,999
Until now, in all the covenants I have taken, I have not written down any needs. I don’t write down needs anymore.

118
00:14:14,000 --> 00:14:23,999
I only say this to the Holy Mother: “Holy Mother, please reveal more of the heavenly greatness to me.” That is all I write in this covenant intentions.

119
00:14:24,000 --> 00:14:32,999
Until the covenant is renewed, I do not write anything more in the covenant intentions.

120
00:14:33,000 --> 00:14:37,999
But this is a miracle. Everything in my life happens without my knowledge.

121
00:14:38,000 --> 00:14:41,999
I give a thousand thanks to the Mother. A thousand thanks.

122
00:14:42,000 --> 00:14:50,999
Isaiah 66:13: “As a mother comforts her child, so I will comfort you; you will experience consolation in Jerusalem.”

123
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:59,999
This is the very precious covenant testimony of this brother, Lijo Joy.

124
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:06,999
What we are hearing at this altar now is what he is sharing: From the first day he took the covenant,

125
00:15:07,000 --> 00:15:14,999
it was to reveal the heavenly greatness through the Holy Mother,

126
00:15:15,000 --> 00:15:23,999
and for spiritual growth. The instructions were written, and he prayed for spiritual growth,

127
00:15:24,000 --> 00:15:31,999
for strengthening spiritually, and at the same time, to witness how the Mother and Jesus helped, arranged, and guided the practical areas of life.

128
00:15:32,000 --> 00:15:38,999
