132
00:16:04,000 --> 00:16:10,999
Only those who go through such life circumstances can truly understand its magnitude.

133
00:16:11,000 --> 00:16:18,999
This is a very true statement, and the brother has shared it with us, guided by the Holy Mother.

134
00:16:19,000 --> 00:16:26,999
She brings her son to her sacred presence, offering him with tears into her hands.

135
00:16:27,000 --> 00:16:33,999
She blesses their married life with the gift of children, as the brother explains.

136
00:16:34,000 --> 00:16:42,999
