138
00:16:51,000 --> 00:16:56,999
Yet the Mother revealed matters through signs to the son.

139
00:16:57,000 --> 00:17:04,999
We give thanks for the Mother’s great protection, the continuous presence of Jesus, His guidance, and help.

140
00:17:05,000 --> 00:17:21,999
Let us join our hands and dedicate this testimony.

141
00:17:22,000 --> 00:17:27,999
Extraordinary divine experiences — may you also have your own.

